e3.long:
Four query types:
(a) per class, "a photo of a {class}": strict = unlabeled images count as wrong, known = those images are dropped;
(b) Localized Narratives captions: R@1/5/10, MRR, median rank;
(c) compositional vi / en queries (e.g. "two dogs on a beach"), hand-judged in judge.html: P@10/20, nDCG;
(d) Vietnamese: direct / translated to English / multilingual CLIP.
Files: a_per_class.csv, a_fp_review.csv (false positives to review), b_captions.csv, c_*_per_query.csv.
